1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,900
Why do onions make you cry?

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,460
Because they're fighting back.

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,340
An onion stores two
ingredients apart.

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,400
Cut it, and they mix.

5
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,840
A special enzyme turns
them into an irritating gas

6
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,520
that drifts up to your eyes.

7
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:18,860
Nerves there feel the sting,
so tears wash it away.

8
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,000
It's probably how onions
put off hungry animals.

9
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,140
Want fewer tears?

10
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,900
Cornell researchers found
that a sharp knife, used

11
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,060
slowly, sprays less mist.
